ROLE: systems_reviewer  VOTE: red
EXISTING_IMPLEMENTATIONS: [
  {system: "AttentionStore/CachedAttention", url: "https://arxiv.org/abs/2403.19708", overlap: "multi-turn KV reuse; hierarchical KV caching; async saving; layer-wise pre-loading; scheduler-aware fetching/eviction"},
  {system: "Pensieve", url: "https://arxiv.org/abs/2312.05516", overlap: "stateful multi-turn serving; GPU+CPU multi-tier KV caching; avoids repeated history processing"},
  {system: "SGLang HiCache", url: "https://docs.sglang.io/docs/advanced_features/hicache_design", overlap: "GPU/CPU/storage hierarchical KV cache; local match, prefetch, write-back; CPU-to-GPU transfer overlap"},
  {system: "vLLM KV offloading connector", url: "https://vllm-project.github.io/2026/01/08/kv-offloading-connector.html", overlap: "CPU DRAM KV offload; optimized H2D/D2H transfers; prefix KV reuse"},
  {system: "Ray Serve + LMCache", url: "https://docs.ray.io/en/latest/serve/llm/user-guides/kv-cache-offloading.html", overlap: "KV offload to CPU/disk for repeated prompts and multi-turn conversations"},
  {system: "TensorRT-LLM KV cache reuse", url: "https://nvidia.github.io/TensorRT-LLM/advanced/kv-cache-reuse.html", overlap: "paged KV block reuse for shared prefixes/multi-turn requests; baseline for prefix-cache recompute"}
]
CONTRIBUTION_TYPE: integration-only
SCALE_REALISM: Does not hold as stated. On the packet's real H100 measurements, demote+prefetch ties reactive fetch at p_rr=1.0 and loses for p_rr<1, where reactive has 1.18x-1.43x higher resume capacity. Real gap distribution is unavailable, so workload realism is still insufficient; sensitivity says median gaps >=0.5s make both prefetch and reactive nearly hide fetch latency. Artifact is reasonably reproducible for microbench/model CSVs, but not an end-to-end shipping scheduler at cluster workload scale.
RATIONALE: PROMPT_VERSION=v001. The claimed mechanism is already present in named prior systems: CachedAttention explicitly uses hierarchical KV caching plus layer-wise pre-loading and asynchronous saving (arXiv:2403.19708); Pensieve uses stateful multi-turn serving with GPU+CPU multi-tier KV caching (arXiv:2312.05516); SGLang HiCache documents GPU/host/storage KV tiers with prefetch/write-back and CPU-to-GPU overlap. The remaining H100 measurement is useful engineering characterization, but the core Pareto claim is refuted by the packet's own baselines: reactive fetch strictly dominates for realistic p_rr<1 and the claimed TTFT edge is only hiding roughly 18ms for 8k KV. Meng/Lee/Wang further pre-empts the offload-vs-recompute crossover framing via kappa_crit for PCIe-bound KV offloading (https://arxiv.org/abs/2601.19910).
